<title>Russia's war in Ukraine: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ukraine/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ukraine-2026-11-28T00:08:55.860Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 00:08:55 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Ukraine is expanding its strike campaign, using naval drones to attack Russian warships in Libya’s Benghazi port and launching more long-range attacks inside Russia, while Russian drones continue to strike Ukraine’s energy, rail and civilian infrastructure, causing civilian deaths. Russia has also violated Finnish airspace with a helicopter and Polish airspace with an unmanned aerial vehicle, prompting NATO to pledge defence against a reported Russian space threat. The UN Security Council warned that winter attacks on Ukraine’s power grid and Black Sea shipping threaten lives and global food supplies. The conflict caused 75,767 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/27/kyiv-offers-black-sea-ceasefire-as-putin-expands-russias-navy?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/26/lana-nusseibeh-uae-sudan-un-secretary-general&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/world/middleeast/libya-ukraine-russia-haftar.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168859&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxOYmlHdGhKd3RFRUNYajhTdlVqdUdrckt5RmtIZEltNjE0OTVPMDhaSS1DTFlGQTU5Z19LRFpLRmpXdVJkcVpRY19iLU40eXpEWUhYdDNjMXhfRkJqckxleW8tY25rOVJFTzlGeGVaUTlwb1M1NVBXSzQwSG9hX2VQR1JiMVhXYk1mdG01ei1nR1ZmOFY5RWpnejVHRkJSa2RVTHRLeURHS3hCSHJMcGluWG1fQWNjS19wTy1RejVTWE5BMW8?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxORmstN09GRzgwLTRXbVhlbHdMSFozZzl1Q21WTzlySzA4aVBSck1nYl9uV0NLYjBJemd5cWt6Zjc1U19ON3hZSlB3UElzVG51RU9iV0pyLWx6dFJ4Y3VpZWxta3c5T0VCTWpvaWVSQUYxTzd5OXdLTGV4T0QwUUlEeTZGRWplT3V4